Apache License 2.0. Upstream source and license are preserved in upstream/.

Overflow-safe RMS and L2 rescaling formulas are adapted from
tetherto/qvac-fabric-llm.cpp/examples/embedding-coreml/export_coreml.py,
commit 2ed826df0c0eefc7135e9c3acc45aaa277f9b6ff, MIT license.
The source file, recipe, requirements and full copyright/license text are
preserved in upstream/qvac/.

Modifications: text-only weights; fixed 128/256/512/1024 sequence lengths;
int32 token input plus float32 right-padding mask; fixed FP32-generated RoPE;
channel-first activations and 1x1 convolutions; explicit attention heads;
inclusive bidirectional sliding-window radius 512; finite -10000 mask;
masked mean including prompt and special tokens before bias-free projection;
overflow-safe normalization; FP16 Core ML encoder weights/compute and FP32
final L2 normalization over the 768 output values; shared-weight
multifunction packaging. Original 768-dimensional normalized embeddings are
preserved. No downstream head projection, truncation, pruning or weight
quantization is applied.

Nemosine and CoreAI cards were consulted as research only. No weights or
converter code from those packages are included in this conversion.
